# Dispel's Vengeance form, and the clearest gain of the swap: the skill it
# replaces cures conditions nothing here inflicts. GMS's 170+6x over ten levels,
# four feathers every three seconds.
#
# GMS triggers them by hitting an enemy, on their own three-second cooldown.
# Here they just fall on that timer: a Bishop always has something to hit, so it
# comes to the same thing.
name: "Triumph Feather"
description:
  "Harness the power of the Angel of Victory. Angel feathers appear and seek "
  "out and attack nearby enemies."
kind: SKILL_KIND_AUTO_ATTACK
tags: SKILL_TAG_VENGEANCE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_PRIEST skill_order: 4 }
max_level: 10
replaces_skill_name: "Dispel"
toggle_skill_name: "Righteously Indignant"
max_enemies: 4
lines: 4
cast_interval_seconds: 3.0
base { skill_pct: 1.76 }
per_level { skill_pct: 0.06 }
